<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN ABORIGINA BEAT BRITAIN 54-24.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN ABORIGINA BEAT BRITAIN 54-24.</headline>
<dateline>WORKINGTON, England 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Aborigina</p>
<p>beat Britain 54-24 (halftime 20-6) in a rugby league match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Broadbent, Diskin, Jones, Mills; Goals -</p>
<p>McGee (4)</p>
<p>Australian Aborigina - Tries: Hookey (3), Anderson (2),</p>
<p>Widders (2), Duncan, Mundine, Waters. Goals: Trindall (6),</p>
<p>Waters.</p>
</text>
